5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"To ensure our chosen project has the hands it needs, I shall examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the money actually goes! I'll check the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it is better to see what actually worked. I will look at the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm looking for the bottlenecks. I'll check the station records from partner field sites and the incident logs on shared instrumentation.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I will focus on the infrastructure. I'll review the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
